{"sha": "3829c1af0b66de3dd953848d4302c9160fc00b98b938f83a4d64ec3d24a7684a", "body": ["\\begin{proof}[部分证明]", "对角化 $2\\times2$ 矩阵 $\\vect n\\cdot\\vect\\sigma =", "\\begin{pmatrix}\\cos\\theta & \\sin\\theta\\,\\eu^{-\\iu\\varphi}\\\\", "\\sin\\theta\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi} & -\\cos\\theta\\end{pmatrix}$：迹为 $0$，", "行列式为 $-1$，本征值为 $\\pm1$；给定的旋量可通过", "代入验证（利用半角公式）。对跖点：$\\theta \\to \\pi -", "\\theta$，$\\varphi \\to \\varphi + \\pi$，则有 $\\braket{+\\vect", "n'}{+\\vect n} = 0$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  \\draw[gray!70] (0,0) circle (2.1);", "  \\draw[gray!70, dashed] (0,0) ellipse (2.1 and 0.6);", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,2.75);", "  \\node[anchor=south] at (0,2.75) {$z$: $\\ket\\uparrow$};", "  \\node[anchor=north, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-2.2) {$\\ket\\downarrow$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (2.7,-0.55);", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (2.7,-0.55) {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (1.35,0.62);", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (1.35,0.66) {$y$};", "  % state vector", "  \\draw[->, omDef, very thick] (0,0) -- (55:2.1);", "  \\node[omDef, anchor=south west] at (55:2.1) {$\\ket{+\\vect n}$};", "  \\draw[omDef, dashed] (0,1.1) arc (90:55:1.1);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize] at (72:1.42) {$\\theta$};", "  % equator states", "  \\fill[omThm] (2.1,0) circle (2pt);", "  \\node[omThm, anchor=west, font=\\footnotesize] at (2.2,0.12)", "    {$(\\ket\\uparrow + \\ket\\downarrow)/\\sqrt2$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 布洛赫球：每个自旋-$\\tfrac12$ 态对应球面上的一点；", "两极为 $\\ket\\uparrow, \\ket\\downarrow$，赤道上是它们的", "等幅叠加，正交态位于对跖点上。", "磁场使球面旋转——这是量子比特的", "“控制面板”。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{磁场中的自旋：进动与共振}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[拉莫尔进动]\\label{prop:b3:spin-two-level:larmor}", "\\index{拉莫尔进动}\\index{旋磁比}", "在静磁场 $\\vect B_0 = B_0\\vect e_z$ 中，哈密顿量 $\\hat", "H = -\\hat{\\vect\\mu}\\cdot\\vect B_0$ 将两能级分裂为", "$\\hbar\\omega_0$，并使平均自旋", "绕磁场\\emph{进动}：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\dd\\langle\\hat{\\vect S}\\rangle}{\\dd t} =", "\\gamma\\,\\langle\\hat{\\vect S}\\rangle\\wedge\\vect B_0 , \\qquad", "\\omega_0 = |\\gamma|B_0 ,", "\\]", "其中旋磁比为 $\\gamma$（$\\mu = \\gamma S$）。布洛赫", "矢量绕 $z$ 轴以 $\\omega_0$ 转动，其与磁场的夹角保持不变", "——正是经典陀螺的图像，在此处严格成立，因为", "对易子是线性的。对电子：$\\qty{28}{GHz/T}$；对", "质子（磁矩为 $2.79$ 核磁子）：$\\gamma_p/2\\pi =", "\\qty{42.6}{MHz/T}$——每台核磁共振成像仪的“车牌号”。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "应用\\cref{prop:b3:quantum-formalism:evolution}，取 $\\hat H =", "-\\gamma B_0\\hat S_z$：对易子给出 $\\dd\\langle\\hat", "S_x\\rangle/\\dd t = -\\gamma B_0\\langle\\hat S_y\\rangle$，", "$\\dd\\langle\\hat S_y\\rangle/\\dd t = +\\gamma B_0\\langle\\hat", "S_x\\rangle$，$\\dd\\langle\\hat S_z\\rangle/\\dd t = 0$，三者", "合成为所述的矢量积。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[磁共振]\\label{prop:b3:spin-two-level:rabi}", "\\index{磁共振}\\index{拉比振荡}", "加上一个在横向平面内转动的弱磁场 $B_1$，", "其频率为 $\\omega$。在随之转动的参考系中，$B_0$ 有效地", "降为 $(\\omega_0 - \\omega)/|\\gamma|$；\\emph{共振", "时}（$\\omega = \\omega_0$）下仅 $B_1$ 起作用，自旋绕它", "进动，以\\emph{拉比频率} $\\Omega_1 =", "|\\gamma|B_1$：从 $\\ket\\uparrow$ 出发，翻转", "的概率为", "\\[", "\\mathcal P_\\downarrow(t) = \\sin^2\\Big(\\frac{\\Omega_1t}{2}\\Big) .", "\\]", "持续时间为 $\\pi/\\Omega_1$ 的脉冲（“$\\pi$ 脉冲”）使自旋", "反转；其一半（“$\\pi/2$ 脉冲”）使其", "位于赤道面内，此时自旋以 $\\omega_0$ 进动，并通过法拉第电磁感应，", "将其频率\\emph{广播}到附近任一线圈中。偏离共振时，", "翻转振幅按 $\\Omega_1^2/[\\Omega_1^2 +", "(\\omega - \\omega_0)^2]$ 急剧衰减：响应具有强烈的选择性，", "即共振——这正是使自旋能够被", "逐种、并借助场梯度逐点寻址的原因", "（见\\cref{pb:b3:spin-two-level:1}）。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "    width=7.0cm, height=4.8cm, xmin=0, xmax=3, ymin=0, ymax=1.15,", "    xlabel={$t$（单位 $2\\pi/\\Omega_1$）}, ylabel={$\\mathcal P_\\downarrow$},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.12)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={0.5,1,1.5,2,2.5}, ytick={0.5,1}, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=0:3, samples=160]", "      {sin(deg(pi*x))^2};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, dashed, domain=0:3, samples=160]", "      {0.36*sin(deg(pi*x/0.6))^2};", "    \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south] at (axis cs:0.5,1.01) {共振};", "    \\node[omExo, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:1.72,0.52) {失谐};", "  \\end{axis}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.9cm, yshift=0.4cm, >=Stealth]", "    \\draw[->, thick] (0,-0.3) -- (0,3.1);", "    \\node[anchor=south] at (0,3.1) {$\\vect B_0$};", "    \\draw[gray, dashed] (0,1.9) ellipse (1.15 and 0.34);", "    \\draw[->, omDef, very thick] (0,0) -- (1.05,2.05);", "    \\draw[->, omDef] (1.18,2.06) arc (5:130:1.16 and 0.35);", "    \\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (1.15,1.35) {$\\langle\\vect S\\rangle$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (0.75,2.85) {$\\omega_0 = |\\gamma|B_0$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}